      "commitSha": "f6f5ee88365c68467268c989489a00f8d1a07d35",
      "commitMessage": "sprites: Tweak horizontal offsets for zombie.\nVanilla Doom doesn't flip X offsets properly when mirroring sprites,\nso adjust mirrored sprites so that the monster is centered within\neach frame and mirrors correctly.\nThese are small tweaks and I've only done frames A-D so far.",
      "commitUrl": "https://github.com/freedoom/freedoom/commit/f6f5ee88365c68467268c989489a00f8d1a07d35",
      "source": "freedoom",
