      "commitMessage": "sprites: improve shotgun guy death. (#1541)\nThis has bothered me for years but it goes by so quick you never really notice it: the shotgun guy's entire abdomen and pelvic area are missing in multiple frames. The body is now restored.\nThe blood on the corpse is also made a little more consistent, and treads have been added to the soles of the boots.",
