      "filePath": "spritesheets/troo.47f0e551a7146d2869940c73193086a8b3a9c50e.6e923b01-281f-41e6-b556-c4c9f995cdf5.webp",
      "commitDate": "2014-01-30T06:46:10.000Z",
      "commitSha": "47f0e551a7146d2869940c73193086a8b3a9c50e",
      "commitMessage": "sprites: Minor sprite fixes.\nThere are a couple of floating pixels away from the sprite that don't\nappear to be part of it in : SKELC2F8 & SKELC4F6 & SKELC5F5 & SKELC6F4\n& SKELG2 & SKELH2 & SKELI4 & SKELK1. They were removed.\nWhite pixel in the bottom left corner of POSSE3E7 & POSSF4F6. White\npixel top left in POSSH0. Recoloured 'white' blood pixels to shades of\nred in POSSI0.\nRemoved out of place white pixels in TROOD4D6 & TROOD5 & TROOE5 &\nTROOF5 & TROOG4G6.",
      "commitUrl": "https://github.com/freedoom/freedoom/commit/47f0e551a7146d2869940c73193086a8b3a9c50e",
      "source": "freedoom",
      "sprites": [
        {
          "spriteUrl": "https://github.com/freedoom/freedoom/blob/47f0e551a7146d2869940c73193086a8b3a9c50e/sprites/nightfang/trooa1.gif",
