      "commitSha": "19cf9d2dedf378108d44ff7885df33c4878b6197",
      "commitMessage": "New sprites for Summoner and Dead Flare\nNew monster sprites by Korp and HorrorMovieRei. New summoner which we dubbed \"Matribite\" due to it being based on the Trilobite, and a new Dead Flare replacement named \"hatchling\" since it is some sort of larvae.\nIncluded is also a tinkered version of the death sound made by mc776 so it synchs better with the new death animation for the Matribite.",
      "commitUrl": "https://github.com/freedoom/freedoom/commit/19cf9d2dedf378108d44ff7885df33c4878b6197",
      "source": "freedoom",
