      "filePath": "spritesheets/skel.383fb42c458cee6d6bd86db7bdf348c241ad540a.9b692293-1441-4687-8849-2cbf2f6bbf3e.webp",
      "commitDate": "2023-07-13T05:19:50.000Z",
      "commitSha": "383fb42c458cee6d6bd86db7bdf348c241ad540a",
      "commitMessage": "sprites: fix up barrel and octo deaths.\nThe base of the barrel remained consistent in its last two frames, causing it to seem very static and unaffected before suddenly disappearing. This adds a bit more of a gradual disintegration.\r\nThe octaminator has a few fixes:\r\n- the tentacle suddenly appearing behind it in the final frame didn't look right. It's been reduced and a hint of it is given in the preceding frame.\r\n- the antepenultimate frame show the right shoulder falling much further to the side than the frame after it shows. That arm is moved closer to the centre.\r\n- got rid of some of the pillow shading on the right front tentacle-leg in the last two frames.",
      "commitUrl": "https://github.com/freedoom/freedoom/commit/383fb42c458cee6d6bd86db7bdf348c241ad540a",
      "source": "freedoom",
