    "ae9c7fba-7964-4693-9e0e-9378512e73c9": {
      "spritesheetId": "ae9c7fba-7964-4693-9e0e-9378512e73c9",
      "fileName": "spid.b1ec7162b988fd52d1b1c1a3656ee151a8f7950f.ae9c7fba-7964-4693-9e0e-9378512e73c9.webp",
      "filePath": "spritesheets/spid.b1ec7162b988fd52d1b1c1a3656ee151a8f7950f.ae9c7fba-7964-4693-9e0e-9378512e73c9.webp",
      "commitDate": "2010-09-08T15:50:50.000Z",
      "commitSha": "b1ec7162b988fd52d1b1c1a3656ee151a8f7950f",
      "commitMessage": "sprites: new spider demon\n:Name: Spider Demon design\n:author: Wesley Johnson\n:date: 4/2/2010\n::END\nemail: john <obfuscate> son 2412 <@> usgo <dot> net\nSpider Demon complete Sprite set.\n  Custom designed spider demon for FreeDoom, to match other existing\n  FreeDoom sprites.\n  This has a unique set of sprites, so cannot use old wadinfo.txt.\nContains files:\n    spid.txt\t\tthis file\n    /sprites  \t\tdirectory of all ppm files\n    wadinfo.txt \tdeutex wadinfo, for only the spid sprites\n- Description:\n  Spider demon with 8 mech. legs, 4 arms, machine gun.\n[ RjY: graphics converted to gif with cyan background, symlinks added,\n  wadinfo.txt appended to spid.txt which can be found in sprites/wesley/\n  Note: every frame is separate - could maybe use optimization? ]\nSigned-off-by: RjY <rjy@users.sourceforge.net>\nSigned-off-by: Mike Swanson <mikeonthecomputer@gmail.com>",
      "commitUrl": "https://github.com/freedoom/freedoom/commit/b1ec7162b988fd52d1b1c1a3656ee151a8f7950f",
